    {
      "id": "jbp-2026-001",
      "title": "Jabalpur Ring Road Project Enters Phase 3: Major Boost for Trans-MP Freight and City Traffic",
      "slug": "jabalpur-ring-road-project-enters-phase-3",
      "excerpt": "The 112-km Jabalpur Ring Road development accelerates with the commencement of the Barela-Bargi bypass stretch, reducing inner-city commercial transit load by 40%.",
      "content": "The National Highways Authority of India (NHAI) and MP Road Development Corporation have initiated the third critical stretch of the multi-lane Jabalpur Outer Ring Road. Spanning between Barela, Bargi, and Tilwaraghat, the corridor will streamline interstate connectivity between Nagpur, Bhopal, and Prayagraj.",
